            "review_text": "Mr Mic\n11 contributions\n0\nWonderful experience\nDec 2023 • Family\nI’ve eaten Bun Cha in many places since I traveled to Vietnam, but I personally liked this restaurant the best in HCM city. \n The restaurant staff were friendly, the food served was hygienic and clean, and it was even better because it had a local Vietnamese atmosphere. The service was a little show, but it didn’t affect the meal that much, and it was good overall, so I recommend it.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2023",
